(# MailFlow Pro) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(MailFlow Pro is a premium Gmail-powered email sending web app with Google OAuth) Tj
T*
(authentication and a modern SaaS-style UI. The frontend is built with React, Vite, and) Tj
T*
(Tailwind CSS, while the backend uses Express, Passport Google OAuth, and Gmail APIs for) Tj
T*
(email sending.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## What was done) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Redesigned the existing app into a modern, premium SaaS-style UI.) Tj
T*
(- Implemented a landing page with a branded hero, Google login button, and responsive) Tj
T*
(layout.) Tj
T*
(- Ensured frontend API requests use the deployed backend URL:) Tj
T*
(`https://mailflow-api-w8kx.onrender.com`.) Tj
T*
(- Added `withCredentials: true` for secure session-based authentication.) Tj
T*
(- Built automatic auth detection and dashboard rendering for logged-in users.) Tj
T*
(- Preserved the existing backend email-sending functionality.) Tj
T*
(- Removed unused frontend starter files and organized components clearly.) Tj
T*
(- Verified production build and GitHub Pages deployment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Features) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Google OAuth login flow via Render backend.) Tj
T*
(- Authenticated dashboard showing user profile photo, name, and Gmail address.) Tj
T*
(- Modern email composer with recipient chips and multi-email paste support.) Tj
T*
(- Responsive mobile-first design with glassmorphism, soft shadows, and smooth spacing.) Tj
T*
(- Production-ready GitHub Pages frontend deployment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Project structure) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `backend/`: Express API, Google auth, email sending controller.) Tj
T*
(- `frontend/`: React app, landing page, dashboard, email composer, deployment config.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Technologies used) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Frontend: React, Vite, Tailwind CSS, Axios, GitHub Pages.) Tj
T*
(- Backend: Node.js, Express, Passport Google OAuth, express-session, CORS.) Tj
T*
(- Deployment: GitHub Pages for frontend, Render for backend.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Local setup) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Clone the repository:) Tj
T*
(   ```bash) Tj
T*
(   git clone https://github.com/mynameisatif/mailflow-pro.git) Tj
T*
(   cd mailflow-pro) Tj
T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
ET
