T*
(2. Setup backend:) Tj
T*
(   ```bash) Tj
T*
(   cd backend) Tj
T*
(   npm install) Tj
T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Create a `.env` file in `backend/` with:) Tj
T*
(   ```env) Tj
T*
(   GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id) Tj
T*
(   GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_google_client_secret) Tj
T*
(   GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL=https://mailflow-api-w8kx.onrender.com/auth/google/callback) Tj
T*
(   SESSION_SECRET=some_secure_secret) Tj
T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Start the backend:) Tj
T*
