T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Setup frontend:) Tj
T*
(   ```bash) Tj
T*
(   cd ../frontend) Tj
T*
(   npm install) Tj
T*
(   npm run dev) Tj
T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Open the app in the browser at `http://localhost:5173`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Deployment) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Frontend is configured for GitHub Pages using `homepage` and `vite.base`.) Tj
T*
(- Deploy frontend from `frontend/` with:) Tj
T*
(  ```bash) Tj
T*
(  npm run deploy) Tj
T*
(  ```) Tj
T*
(- Backend should be deployed to Render with CORS and session support enabled.) Tj
T*
(- Live frontend URL: `https://mynameisatif.github.io/mailflow-pro/`) Tj
T*
(- API base URL: `https://mailflow-api-w8kx.onrender.com`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## How it runs) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. User visits the landing page.) Tj
T*
(2. If not authenticated, the app shows the login hero and a Google login button.) Tj
T*
(3. Clicking the button redirects to the backend `/auth/google` route.) Tj
T*
(4. Upon successful login, the backend redirects back to the frontend.) Tj
T*
ET
